79294586,"text":"うーん…なんか違う…","nextNodeIds":[220450102]},{"nodeId":220450102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3408566386,"text":"どうしたの？","nextNodeIds":[220450103]},{"nodeId":220450103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":1110237338,"text":"旅人！ちょうどいい時に来た、君を探してたんだ！","nextNodeIds":[220450104]},{"nodeId":220450104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":151641346,"text":"最近木彫りを作ってる時に思ったんだが…完成した木彫りに生気を感じない…","nextNodeIds":[220450105,220450107]},{"nodeId":220450105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2800772562,"text":"木彫りだからね。","nextNodeIds":[220450106]},{"nodeId":220450106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":1081941978,"text":"まあ、そうなんだが…","nextNodeIds":[220450108]},{"nodeId":220450108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":1063991650,"text":"ああ…なんて言うか…俺の求めてる「生気」は、活力なんだ。","nextNodeIds":[220450109]},{"nodeId":220450109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":3015885394,"text":"ほら、代理宮司様は普段寝てるけど、たまには起きてうろうろするだろ。","nextNodeIds":[220450110]},{"nodeId":220450110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":203949946,"text":"そうしてる時、代理宮司様は飛び跳ねたり、落ち葉に飛びついたり、背伸びをしたりする…","nextNodeIds":[220450111]},{"nodeId":220450111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":3516602042,"text":"そういう動作が、俺の求めてる活力なんだ。それを原型に木彫りを作れば、「生気」を込めた作品になると思う…","nextNodeIds":[220450112,220450113]},{"nodeId":220450112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1678740258,"text":"じゃあ直接観察すれば…","nextNodeIds":[220450114]},{"nodeId":220450114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":841690218,"text":"いや、俺は…ちょっと照れくさくて…","nextNodeIds":[220450115]},{"nodeId":220450115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":3928858554,"text":"代理宮司様は俺に給料をくれる雇い主だ、そんな俺が横からじっと観察したら、代理宮司様もきっと良いように思わない…","nextNodeIds":[220450116]},{"nodeId":220450116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":3952770930,"text":"君は代理宮司様とも仲が良いだろ、俺の代わりに写真を何枚か撮ってきてくれないか。","nextNodeIds":[220450117,220450118]},{"nodeId":220450117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":45942218,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[220450121]},{"nodeId":220450121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":3263713234,"text":"それじゃ頼んだよ、写真を撮ったら、俺のところに持ってきてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220450118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":187060826,"text":"欲しい動作が撮れなかったら…","nextNodeIds":[220450119]},{"nodeId":220450119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":1874952778,"text":"大丈夫、大きな動作は撮らなくてもいい。どうせ今の俺の技術では、ああいう動作を再現することはできないしな…","nextNodeIds":[220450120]},{"nodeId":220450120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"大島純平","textMapHash":3421839146,"text":"代理宮司様の自然としてる姿を撮ってきてくれ。それで十分参考になるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[220450121]},{"nodeId":220450113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":594266146,"text":"寝子はすぐそこにいるけど。","nextNodeIds":[220450114]},{"nodeId":220450107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2535881546,"text":"どんな「生気」を目指してるの？","nextNodeIds":[220450108]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2204501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_UI","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP"